<title>FRANCE: Algeria seeks 150,000 tns wheat.</title>
<headline>Algeria seeks 150,000 tns wheat.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algeria will tender on Tuesday for 150,000 tonnes of bread-making wheat of optional origin, European grain traders said on Monday.</p>
<p>The wheat is for July and August shipment, they said.</p>
